{
  "name": {
    "ja": "Shu–Osher：特性WENO-Zと高解像度参照",
    "en": "Shu–Osher: characteristic WENO-Z and a numerical reference"
  },
  "scope": {
    "ja": "[-5,5]で衝撃波と密度正弦波の干渉をt=1.8まで計算。100/200点の特性FD WENO-Zを800点の同じ実装と比較し、参照との差と近似境界収支を別々に記録する。",
    "en": "Evolve shock/entropy-wave interaction on [-5,5] to t=1.8. Compare characteristic FD WENO-Z at 100/200 points with the same implementation at 800 points, separately recording reference disagreement and approximate boundary balance."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "γ=1.4、初期不連続x=−4、左(ρ,u,p)=(3.857143,2.629369,10.33333)、右ρ=1+0.2sin(5x),u=0,p=1。初期不連続を各格子の界面へ合わせる。点値FD、大域LF分割、界面固定Roe特性基底、WENO-Z指数2、ε=10^-6、SSPRK3、CFL=0.3。",
    "en": "γ=1.4, initial jump x=−4, left (ρ,u,p)=(3.857143,2.629369,10.33333), and right ρ=1+0.2sin(5x), u=0, p=1. The initial jump aligns with a face on every grid. Pointwise FD, global LF splitting, face-frozen Roe characteristics, WENO-Z exponent 2, ε=10^-6, SSPRK3 and CFL=0.3 are used."
  },
  "units": {
    "ja": "長さ・時間・Euler変数は無次元。固定εはこの無次元流束の尺度に対する値で、任意単位系へ自動転用しない。",
    "en": "Length, time and Euler variables are nondimensional. Fixed ε refers to this nondimensional flux scaling and is not automatically transferable to arbitrary units."
  },
  "boundaries": {
    "ja": "端点初期値を固定したゴースト値。連続の遠方流束を差し引いた収支には、静止した非一様密度を固定ゴーストで扱うFD境界離散化誤差が残る。丸め誤差保存とは区別する。",
    "en": "Ghost values are fixed to initial endpoint states. Balance against continuous far-field fluxes retains FD boundary discretization error for the nonuniform stationary density with fixed ghosts; this is distinct from roundoff conservation."
  },
  "method_ids": [
    "weno-z"
  ],
  "reading": {
    "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/ja/read/reconstruction/",
