  "failure_scope": {
    "ja": "800点は同一手法の数値参照で、厳密解や独立solverではない。0.15の平均密度差は構造の再現を見る教材用の解像度基準であり、高精度認証ではない。格子倍増で差が減ることだけを判定し、形式次数は付与しない。正の出力と棄却回数を記録しても、全入力の正値性定理にはならない。",
    "en": "The 800-point solution is a same-method numerical reference, not an exact solution or independent solver. The mean-density difference bound of 0.15 is an educational structure-resolution criterion, not a high-accuracy certification. Only decreasing discrepancy under grid doubling is tested; no formal order is assigned. Positive outputs and counted rejections do not establish positivity for every input."
  },
  "reference_notes": {
    "ja": "高解像度の保存変数の点値を各100/200点の格子中心へ線形補間する。誤差はそれぞれ同じ場所・t=1.8で平均する。CSVは200点の計算・参照を並べる。近似収支の許容値0.2%は固定境界の離散化誤差を許すためであり、密度誤差0.15の判定とは別。",
    "en": "Higher-resolution conserved point values are linearly interpolated to each 100/200-point grid's centers. Errors are averaged at matching locations and t=1.8; CSV pairs the 200-point solution and reference. The 0.2% approximate-balance allowance accommodates fixed-boundary discretization and is separate from the density-error bound of 0.15."
  },
